0 到 1440 的整数进行校验；非法行通过异常捕获计入 invalid_count，解析与行有效性逻辑符合要求。\",\n      \"suggested_self_test\": null,\n      \"next_action\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"C03\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issue_type\": null,\n      \"evidence_span\": \"duration = None if raw == \\\"\\\" else int(raw)\\n...\\nif duration is None:\\n            out[\\\"missing_duration_count\\\"] += 1\\n        else:\\n            out[\\\"known_duration_count\\\"] += 1\",\n      \"reason\": \"空白分钟被解析为 None 并计入 missing_duration_count，非空分钟（包括 0）计入 known_duration_count，正确区分了未知与已知 0，计数逻辑符合要求。\",\n      \"suggested_self_test\": null,\n      \"next_action\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"C04\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issue_type\": null,\n      \"evidence_span\": \"out[\\\"known_minutes\\\"] += duration\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅对已知分钟行执行累加，duration 为 None 时不会进入 else 分支，因此不会把未知值加入总和；已知 0 分钟累加 0 不影响结果，累加逻辑正确。\",\n      \"suggested_self_test\": null,\n      \"next_action\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"C05\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issue_type\": null,\n      \"evidence_span\": \"out = {\\\"record_count\\\": 0, \\\"known_duration_count\\\": 0, \\\"known_minutes\\\": 0,\\n           \\\"missing_duration_count\\\": 0, \\\"invalid_count\\\": 0}\\n...\\nreturn out\",\n      \"reason\": \"函数在循环前初始化五个整数字段，即使没有有效行也会返回完整字典，满足空有效集的完整返回要求。\",\n      \"suggested_self_test\": null,\n      \"next_action\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"C06\",\n      \"verdict\": \"pass\",\n      \"issue_type\": null,\n      \"evidence_span\": \"import csv\\nimport io\\n\\ndef summarize_records(csv_text: str) -> dict:\\n    reader = csv.DictReader(io.StringIO(csv_text))\",\n      \"reason\": \"代码仅使用标准库 csv 和 io 在内存中解析字符串，未进行文件读写、网络访问或执行任意代码，符合纯函数与静态边界要求。\",\n      \"suggested_self_test\": null,\n      \"next_action\": null\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,